## Interface: 20506
## Title: Gearing Tool Companion
## Notes: Companion to WowSimsExporter. Dumps bank contents, bag contents, reputation standings, and arena team ratings (none of which WowSimsExporter covers) to SavedVariables, no clipboard needed. Minimap button (left-click: save, right-click: status panel) for less technical use.
## SavedVariables: GTCompanionDB, GTCompanionMinimapDB
## Author: gearing-tool

